USE	BOOK	base.txt
# 予定どおりに払う。新しい実績のIDがPAID-BYで予定を閉じ、今日の目安から外れる
APPLY	pay-on-due
PUT-ENTRY	NEW	phone-2027-01
TX	tx-0005	2027-02-01	DESC	phone bill
EFFECT	bank	jpy	-3000
EFFECT	phone	jpy	3000
ENDTX
AFTER	pay-on-due.after.txt
